        <mxCell id="c-n-pool" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#12456E" value="Weighted or priority round-robin across instances, with a circuit breaker that pulls a TPM-throttled endpoint out of rotation on 429 and retries the next one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is why the application only ever knows ONE endpoint — capacity, region spread and failover are gateway configuration, not application code." vertex="1">
